§ `JSA 6: work-related requirements`

#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(1) the claimant must comply with the work-related requirement` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(1) the claimant must comply with the work-related requirement` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
