#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6C(1) the requirement is a work preparation requirement` `s 49 JSA 6 to do something else`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6D(1) the requirement is a work search requirement` `s 49 JSA 6B(1) to participate in one or more work-focused interviews as specified by the Secretary of State`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6D(1) the requirement is a work search requirement` `s 49 JSA 6C(1) to take particular action specified by the Secretary of State to make paid work more likely in the opinion of the Secretary of State`)
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6D(1) the requirement is a work search requirement` `s 49 JSA 6D(1) to take all reasonable action and any particular action specified by the Secretary of State for the purpose of obtaining paid work`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6D(1) the requirement is a work search requirement` `s 49 JSA 6E(1) to be available for work`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6D(1) the requirement is a work search requirement` `s 49 JSA 6 to do something else`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6E(1) the requirement is a work availability requirement` `s 49 JSA 6B(1) to participate in one or more work-focused interviews as specified by the Secretary of State`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6E(1) the requirement is a work availability requirement` `s 49 JSA 6C(1) to take particular action specified by the Secretary of State to make paid work more likely in the opinion of the Secretary of State`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6E(1) the requirement is a work availability requirement` `s 49 JSA 6D(1) to take all reasonable action and any particular action specified by the Secretary of State for the purpose of obtaining paid work`)
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6E(1) the requirement is a work availability requirement` `s 49 JSA 6E(1) to be available for work`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 49 JSA 6E(1) the requirement is a work availability requirement` `s 49 JSA 6 to do something else`)
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(2) the requirement is a work-related requirement` `s 49 JSA 6B(1) to participate in one or more work-focused interviews as specified by the Secretary of State`
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(2) the requirement is a work-related requirement` `s 49 JSA 6C(1) to take particular action specified by the Secretary of State to make paid work more likely in the opinion of the Secretary of State`
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(2) the requirement is a work-related requirement` `s 49 JSA 6D(1) to take all reasonable action and any particular action specified by the Secretary of State for the purpose of obtaining paid work`
