#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(2) the section that gives the meaning of the requirement` `work preparation requirement` EQUALS "6C"
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(2) the section that gives the meaning of the requirement` `work search requirement` EQUALS "6D"
#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6(2) the section that gives the meaning of the requirement` `work availability requirement` EQUALS "6E"

§ `JSA 6A: claimant commitment`

#ASSERT `s 49 JSA 6A(1) the document is a claimant commitment` TRUE `income-based jobseeker's allowance`
