`6J none` MEANS `s 49 JSA 6J(2) failure` WITH
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work preparation requirement to undertake a work placement` IS FALSE
    `the work placement was of a prescribed description` IS (JUST FALSE)
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work search requirement to apply for a particular vacancy for paid work` IS FALSE
    `the claimant failed to comply with a work availability requirement by not taking up an offer of paid work` IS FALSE
    `the claimant ceased paid work or lost pay in a way that counts under paragraph (d)` IS (JUST FALSE)

`6J(2)(a) prescribed` MEANS `s 49 JSA 6J(2) failure` WITH
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work preparation requirement to undertake a work placement` IS TRUE
    `the work placement was of a prescribed description` IS (JUST TRUE)
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work search requirement to apply for a particular vacancy for paid work` IS FALSE
    `the claimant failed to comply with a work availability requirement by not taking up an offer of paid work` IS FALSE
    `the claimant ceased paid work or lost pay in a way that counts under paragraph (d)` IS (JUST FALSE)

`6J(2)(a) not prescribed` MEANS `s 49 JSA 6J(2) failure` WITH
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work preparation requirement to undertake a work placement` IS TRUE
    `the work placement was of a prescribed description` IS (JUST FALSE)
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work search requirement to apply for a particular vacancy for paid work` IS FALSE
    `the claimant failed to comply with a work availability requirement by not taking up an offer of paid work` IS FALSE
    `the claimant ceased paid work or lost pay in a way that counts under paragraph (d)` IS (JUST FALSE)

`6J(2)(a) prescribed unknown` MEANS `s 49 JSA 6J(2) failure` WITH
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work preparation requirement to undertake a work placement` IS TRUE
    `the work placement was of a prescribed description` IS NOTHING
    `the claimant failed to comply with a requirement under a work search requirement to apply for a particular vacancy for paid work` IS FALSE
